#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Select recipients using filters like Members, Prospects, or Event Attendees."
msgstr ""
"Vælg modtagerne ved hjælp af filtre som \"Medlemmer\", \"Interesserede\" "
"eller \"Deltagere i arrangementet\"."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Send <strong>professional offers</strong> for meeting room packages, private "
"offices, or custom services."
msgstr ""
"Send os dine <strong>professionelle tilbud</strong> på pakker til "
"konferencerum, private kontorer eller skræddersyede services."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Send members the new Wi-Fi code, upcoming events, and important updates via "
"<strong>Email Marketing</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Send medlemmerne den nye WLAN-kode, information om kommende begivenheder og "
"vigtige opdateringer via <strong>E-mailmarketingappen</strong>."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid "Send or schedule your email and track opens and clicks."
msgstr "Send eller planlæg dine e-mails, og følg åbne- og klikrater."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid "Send quotes and invoices automatically."
msgstr "Send tilbud og fakturaer automatisk."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Set a Loyalty Rule to give <strong>10 points</strong> when the product is "
"purchased."
msgstr ""
"Opret en loyalitetsregel, så der gives <strong>10 point</strong> ved køb af "
"produktet."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Set a Reward where <strong>1 point = 100% discount on 1 coworking day</"
"strong>.<br/>\n"
"                        → As the client books coworking days, they apply "
"their points at checkout. Once all 10 points are used, the standard day "
"price applies for future bookings."
msgstr ""
"Fastsæt en belønning, hvor <strong>1 point = 100 % rabat på 1 dag i "
"kontorfællesskabet</strong>.<br/>\n"
"                        → Når kunder reserverer dage i kontorfællesskabet, "
"kan deres point bruges i betalingsprocessen. Når alle 10 point er brugt, "
"gælder standardprisen for fremtidige reservationer."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Set the product type to <strong>Service – Membership / Partnership</strong> "
"for subscription offers (Business Address and Unlimited monthly access)."
msgstr ""
"Indstil produkttypen for abonnementstilbud (forretningsadresse og ubegrænset "
"månedlig adgang) til <strong>Service – Medlemskab/partnerskab</strong>."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid "Set time slots, ticket types, and attendance limits if needed."
msgstr "Fastlæg om nødvendigt tidsintervaller, sagstyper og pladser."

#. module: coworking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:coworking.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Share event links via email or social media so members and guests can sign "
"up easily."
msgstr ""
"Del links til begivenheden via e-mail eller sociale medier, så medlemmer og "
"gæster nemt kan tilmelde sig."

